{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Protocol is a <strong>high-stakes, turn-based 4X space strategy</strong> game distilled into intense one-hour matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for players who want <strong>tactical depth without mid-game bloat</strong>, every session delivers a new strategic challenge against <strong>AI opponents who don't just participate but play to win</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead one of the six cosmic factions for galactic dominance, but be prepared: the space is unforgivable and victories must be earned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Empire Across the Galaxy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish your empire by constructing space stations and extending your network through <strong>planetary colonization</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>stations</strong> to <strong>harvest resources</strong> from asteroids, gas giants, and stars. Improve their efficiency with refinery stations or by <strong>terraforming</strong> planets to support industry, research, or logistics. Every placement shapes the future of your empire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/extras/8eb277e511eac36dc54aed6271273d64.poster.avif?t=1773920460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/extras/8eb277e511eac36dc54aed6271273d64.webm?t=1773920460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/extras/8eb277e511eac36dc54aed6271273d64.mp4?t=1773920460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical One-Unit-Per-Tile Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat takes place on a <strong>one-unit-per-tile hex grid</strong> where positioning is everything. Each ship has <strong>distinct roles</strong>, attack profiles, shields, armor, and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble fleets, <strong>upgrade</strong> <strong>ships</strong>, and exploit enemy weaknesses to gain the upper hand against rival factions and a capable AI that actively competes for victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/extras/6846835847042bec77980952f1014b0b.poster.avif?t=1773920460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/extras/6846835847042bec77980952f1014b0b.webm?t=1773920460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/extras/6846835847042bec77980952f1014b0b.mp4?t=1773920460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research, Adapt, and Replay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new <strong>technologies across three branches</strong> to unlock ships, stations, terraforming options, and upgrades. Technology choices are randomized each run, forcing you to adapt rather than follow fixed build orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>six playable factions</strong> with <strong>distinct mechanics</strong> and strategic strengths. Combined with randomized maps, minor factions, technologies, anomalies, and victory conditions, every match presents a new strategic situation to navigate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore anomalies</strong> scattered across the galaxy, each offering <strong>unpredictable rewards</strong> from abandoned vessels to powerful technologies that can reshape your plans.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/extras/6c1e2af0bc32291a5a7bb6e9ec83a4f9.poster.avif?t=1773920460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/extras/6c1e2af0bc32291a5a7bb6e9ec83a4f9.webm?t=1773920460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/extras/6c1e2af0bc32291a5a7bb6e9ec83a4f9.mp4?t=1773920460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race for Victory</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is a race toward victory under changing conditions. Win by completing\u00a0<strong>randomized victory objectives</strong> through expansion, combat, or exploration or by <strong>destroying your rivals</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Protocol features a <strong>smart, assertive AI</strong> developed in close collaboration with <strong>Xilmi</strong>, known for AI overhauls for <i>OpenXCOM</i> and <i>Remnants of the Precursors</i>. Expect <strong>opponents</strong> that <strong>play to win</strong> and force you to adapt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/extras/029047d3264ab0ae05301b1f68a28eaa.poster.avif?t=1773920460\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/extras/029047d3264ab0ae05301b1f68a28eaa.webm?t=1773920460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/extras/029047d3264ab0ae05301b1f68a28eaa.mp4?t=1773920460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability in Numbers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 playable factions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 minor factions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>22 ship types</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 planet types</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ technologies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ anomalies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 victory conditions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 map generators</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"United Tellus Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3727420/43581a17695f02cc7b9cc0f11f30309c24067605.jpg"},{"name":"Myrmidon Horde Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3727420/6c601aabe1ac77eb72bbaeefa4f6ed49f28f2d65.jpg"},{"name":"Santri Syndicate Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3727420/5365cb8982573a955eb0f7020684baf4e3ecc656.jpg"},{"name":"Erdi System Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3727420/114838b7d4fb4f9ab290f3b93068a385a51f9020.jpg"},{"name":"Yimono Union Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3727420/84157e872d75fa6271a2eae21b72eea662aa94fc.jpg"},{"name":"Thermortis Generation Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3727420/cfe39ba0f9542ad2e7c13e120cecefd52ff743c9.jpg"},{"name":"Victory on Small Map","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3727420/415469ecabe8cb8aec7644c617cc426acdbdca3d.jpg"},{"name":"Victory on Medium Map","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3727420/fc2690bb27dddffd04b3fb63099c0def36ef1eed.jpg"},{"name":"Victory on Large Map","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3727420/81e13ee97c8185f421f40819d48fa6b4ca8c7567.jpg"},{"name":"Victory on Larger Map","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3727420/308a595f3df8ca522f20da84f6252a96bf967858.jpg"}],"total":45},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727420?t=1773920460","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727420?t=1773920460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/89b5acdff9f1084e97aaf02dfef601d5a995c5a5/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1773920460","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727420/89b5acdff9f1084e97aaf02dfef601d5a995c5a5/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1773920460","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3769680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Protocol is a <strong>high-stakes, turn-based 4X space strategy</strong> game distilled into intense one-hour matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for players who want <strong>tactical depth without mid-game bloat</strong>, every session delivers a new strategic challenge against <strong>AI opponents who don't just participate but play to win</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead one of the six cosmic factions for galactic dominance, but be prepared: the space is u